The system shall allow a registered user to provide a supported coding-platform username.
FR-016
The system shall validate whether the supplied username can be retrieved from the supported platform.
FR-017
The system shall retrieve available coding-profile information through the platform's API.
FR-018
The system shall retrieve available contest-related information.
FR-019
The system shall retrieve available submission/problem-related information.
FR-020
The system shall handle unsuccessful API requests without exposing internal system errors to the user.
FR-021
The system shall prevent unnecessary repeated requests to external APIs where appropriate.
---
10. Coding Profile Data
The system shall maintain relevant information associated with a user's connected coding profile.
FR-022
The system shall store the connected platform name.
FR-023
The system shall store the platform username.
FR-024
The system shall maintain the user's current rating when available.
FR-025
The system shall maintain the user's maximum rating when available.
FR-026
