23. External System Dependencies
The application may depend on external competitive-programming APIs.
The initial integration target is:
Codeforces API
The architecture must account for:
API availability
API response structure
rate limits
API errors
data changes
synchronization frequency
The system should isolate external API communication from the rest of the application so that future integrations can be added without significantly changing the core application.
