28. Requirement Prioritization
Requirements will later be prioritized using the following categories:
Must Have
Required for the MVP.
Examples:
Authentication
User profile
Codeforces integration
Data synchronization
Dashboard
Basic analytics
Should Have
Important but not essential for the first usable release.
Examples:
Advanced visualizations
Goal tracking
Interview preparation
Additional analytics
Could Have
Useful enhancements that can be implemented if time permits.
Examples:
Friend comparison
Additional platform integrations
Advanced dashboard customization
Won't Have Initially
Features intentionally excluded from the initial release.
Examples:
Mobile application
Code execution platform
Advanced AI/agent systems
