29. MVP Definition
The Minimum Viable Product will provide the following core workflow:
```text
Register
   ↓
Login
   ↓
Create Profile
   ↓
Connect Codeforces Account
   ↓
Retrieve Coding Data
   ↓
Store Data
   ↓
Process Statistics
   ↓
Display Dashboard
   ↓
View Analytics
```
The MVP should allow a real user to complete this workflow successfully.
